    "note": "No per-digit Model Option Table (MOT) digit template could be resolved. The SEL-2741 is a configurable managed Ethernet switch ordered through SEL's online Model Option Table configurator; SEL's instruction manual lists the ordering DIMENSIONS but not a positional part-number string, and no genuine part number, ordering-doc MOT, or digit-position drawing anchor was available to calibrate against (the drawing layers key off text labels, not digit positions). No positions are asserted to avoid inventing them. Configurable ordering dimensions per Table 3 of the instruction manual: (1) Conformal Coat Yes/No; (2) Power Supply Position One and (3) Position Two, each independently Low Voltage 24-48 Vdc or High Voltage 125-250 Vdc / 120-240 Vac (redundant supplies); (4) Communication Ports 1=24x100/1000BASE-T + 0 SFP, 2=20 T + 4 SFP, 3=16 T + 8 SFP, 4=12 T + 12 SFP, 5=8 T + 16 SFP, 6=4 T + 20 SFP, 7=0 T + 24 SFP (100/1000BASE SFP cages); (5) Digital Input 1=24 V, 2=48 V, 3=125 V, 4=250 V; (6) Ethernet Switching Technology RSTP / OT SDN (Unmanaged is a future release); (7) Mounting Rack / Panel / Surface.",
